WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:05.000
Hey, I'm totally stuffed now!

00:05.000 --> 00:06.860
What <i>was</i> that, anyway?

00:05.980 --> 00:07.270
Jiggle...

00:06.860 --> 00:09.780
That practically bucket-sized 
dish we just had?

00:09.780 --> 00:12.400
It's bucket pudding!

00:12.400 --> 00:14.660
Woo-hoo! Woo-hoo!

00:14.660 --> 00:16.880
Woo-hoo! Woo-hoo!

00:14.660 --> 00:16.880
You've still got room 
for more, right, Sophie?

00:16.880 --> 00:18.360
I do, naturally.

00:18.360 --> 00:20.280
What do you mean, naturally?

00:22.580 --> 00:23.290
What's this?

00:24.000 --> 00:26.290
Oh, the cargo is stuck in here.

00:26.600 --> 00:27.840
Excuse me...

00:27.840 --> 00:29.600
Whose wagon is this?

00:29.600 --> 00:32.460
If you can't pass through, 
you should take the main road.

00:32.460 --> 00:33.970
Oh, I'm terribly sorry!

00:35.430 --> 00:37.240
You're a centaur!

00:37.240 --> 00:38.360
Indeed I am.

00:38.970 --> 00:39.900
My name is...

00:39.900 --> 00:41.720
Huh? Is that you, Dione?

00:41.990 --> 00:43.980
Oh! Great—

00:46.730 --> 00:49.530
The fact that I was the 
Great Hero is a secret!

00:49.530 --> 00:50.460
Got it?!

00:51.840 --> 00:53.120
Do you two know each other?

00:53.120 --> 00:53.560
Huh?

00:53.560 --> 00:56.490
Well, maybe we do, or maybe we don't...

00:56.490 --> 00:57.740
Which is it?

00:59.620 --> 01:03.890
Great— I mean, Blade and I go way back!

01:03.890 --> 01:06.250
Back when Blade was the Great— wait, no!

01:06.250 --> 01:07.690
More importantly!

01:07.690 --> 01:09.130
What are you gonna do about this cargo?

01:09.590 --> 01:11.070
Oh, that's right.

01:11.070 --> 01:13.750
If you'd like, we'd be happy to help out.

01:13.750 --> 01:14.510
Yes.

01:14.800 --> 01:16.400
Leave it to me!

01:16.400 --> 01:18.180
We dragons are powerful!

01:18.860 --> 01:20.430
I would appreciate your help.

01:21.260 --> 01:24.030
Are you all members of Blade's party?

01:24.030 --> 01:26.190
No! They're my friends.

01:27.560 --> 01:29.190
I see.

01:29.920 --> 01:32.320
So? Where are we hauling this?

01:32.320 --> 01:34.440
Oh, yes. That'd be...

01:34.440 --> 01:36.820
Oh! Took you long enough!

01:37.430 --> 01:39.520
It was the old fart's cargo?

01:39.520 --> 01:41.080
That's lèse-majesté, Blade.

01:41.400 --> 01:42.870
Your Majesty.

01:42.870 --> 01:44.890
I've brought it here, as per your command.

01:44.890 --> 01:46.670
Good going!

01:46.670 --> 01:50.480
On that note, I have your 
next assignment ready.

01:50.480 --> 01:51.090
Yes!

01:51.690 --> 01:52.500
As you wish!

01:52.500 --> 01:53.760
Okay!

01:53.760 --> 01:57.720
Starting today, you will be teaching at
 Rosewood Academy as an instructor.

01:57.720 --> 01:59.140
What?!

01:59.140 --> 02:01.780
That came out of nowhere!

02:01.780 --> 02:04.850
Blade is well aware of her abilities.

02:04.850 --> 02:07.100
She should be more than qualified 
to act as your instructor.

02:07.100 --> 02:08.640
Well, yeah...

02:08.640 --> 02:11.020
Well, then, best of luck to you!

02:11.390 --> 02:12.100
Yes!

02:12.800 --> 02:14.230
I look forward to teaching you!

02:14.230 --> 02:15.820
Great— wait, no!

02:15.820 --> 02:16.970
Blade!

02:17.420 --> 02:19.160
Is this really gonna work?

02:21.380 --> 02:23.020
Hm...

02:30.210 --> 02:34.220
<i>I look in your eyes, and I'm met with</i>

02:34.220 --> 02:38.770
<i>A brand-new me and dream</i>

02:48.810 --> 02:51.520
<i>Bravery? Naturally?</i>

02:51.520 --> 02:54.110
<i>Polar opposites within the heart</i>

02:54.110 --> 02:56.780
<i>But, you know, wanting to have both</i>

02:56.780 --> 02:59.410
<i>That's the saga of human nature</i>

02:59.410 --> 03:01.970
<i>Oh no, don't mind me</i>

03:01.970 --> 03:04.910
<i>Go ahead, and so on, you know the rest</i>

03:04.910 --> 03:07.170
<i>A little more? Wait, even harder?!</i>

03:07.170 --> 03:10.080
<i>Going overboard much?</i>

03:10.080 --> 03:12.090
<i>Those selfish emotions deep down</i>

03:12.090 --> 03:14.670
<i>Bringing them to light is 
what friendship's about</i>

03:14.670 --> 03:17.680
<i>Spending adolescence duking it out with pals</i>

03:17.680 --> 03:20.930
<i>I don't wanna lose</i>

03:21.350 --> 03:24.230
<i>We're off to the cutting edge moment</i>

03:24.230 --> 03:28.060
<i>Fight with best friends, and leave no regrets</i>

03:28.060 --> 03:33.020
<i>You should laugh, since 
you look best with a smile</i>

03:33.020 --> 03:38.650
<i>On the ropes?! No matter 
what we face, et cetera</i>

03:38.650 --> 03:41.660
<i>Just sit back and enjoy it</i>

03:41.660 --> 03:48.850
<i>Whatever may come, I'll 
be here to protect you</i>

03:55.830 --> 03:59.000
<b>Episode 6</b>

03:56.590 --> 03:59.000
<b>The General and the Sacred Bird</b>

04:02.290 --> 04:03.680
What's going on here?

04:03.680 --> 04:06.220
Wait, who's that?

04:06.900 --> 04:08.800
Is that God Iron?

04:08.800 --> 04:09.720
Sure is.

04:09.720 --> 04:12.160
Back in the day, we used boulders instead.

04:29.820 --> 04:33.410
I thought God Iron was indestructible.

04:33.410 --> 04:35.540
Oh, is that what's normal?

04:36.100 --> 04:38.850
It's not just destroyed, it's melting...

04:38.850 --> 04:40.250
Wow...

04:51.890 --> 04:54.320
I'm finally feeling all warmed up!

04:54.320 --> 04:56.100
Okay, let's begin class!

04:58.350 --> 05:00.100
Introduce yourself first!

05:00.100 --> 05:01.400
You're right!

05:02.300 --> 05:04.080
I am Dione!

05:04.080 --> 05:06.160
Dione, the Demon Lance!

05:06.160 --> 05:10.060
If any of you feel confident enough, 
take up your sword and face me!

05:10.060 --> 05:12.580
Wait, you're not here to fight a duel!

05:12.580 --> 05:15.050
Dione, the Demon Lance?

05:15.050 --> 05:16.010
What?!

05:16.010 --> 05:19.210
Are you General Dione,
 commander of the top cavalry corps?!

05:19.210 --> 05:20.920
General?!

05:21.920 --> 05:23.680
A bonafide hero!

05:23.680 --> 05:27.120
Someone so accomplished is 
going to be our teacher?

05:27.120 --> 05:28.230
Oh, no!

05:28.230 --> 05:30.320
Before the Great Hero, I'm not...

05:30.320 --> 05:30.910
Ah!

05:30.910 --> 05:31.640
Hey!

05:32.840 --> 05:36.940
So, Miss Dione, you've had the privilege 
of seeing the Great Hero fight in person!

05:37.290 --> 05:40.610
W-W-Well, that's all in the past...

05:40.610 --> 05:44.840
But then how does someone 
like you know Blade?

05:46.530 --> 05:49.930
Do you think Miss Dione is 
acquaintances with Blade?

05:49.930 --> 05:51.070
Hm...

05:51.070 --> 05:53.160
Consider me interested.

05:54.840 --> 05:58.040
Parent, that tickles!

05:58.040 --> 06:00.030
Stop squirming already!

06:01.650 --> 06:03.390
No weird noises!

06:07.730 --> 06:12.510
I always just bathe in cold water, 
but this is pretty good, too!

06:11.280 --> 06:13.880
How's everything feel, Sis?

06:13.880 --> 06:15.650
Let's get that sweat wiped off.

06:15.650 --> 06:17.890
I'm in heaven!

06:17.890 --> 06:22.610
Have you known Blade for a long time, Sis?

06:22.610 --> 06:26.470
I-I-I only met Blade the other day!

06:26.470 --> 06:29.110
Back then, you said you two went way back.

06:29.110 --> 06:31.210
Th-That's, well...

06:31.210 --> 06:32.520
Hey, Sis.

06:32.520 --> 06:36.120
I'd love to hear you talk about 
what Blade was like in the past.

06:36.120 --> 06:38.750
I'd be interested in that, too!

06:40.500 --> 06:43.340
Please tell us, Sis!

06:43.340 --> 06:44.740
That's the spot!

06:44.740 --> 06:46.630
Keep going, right there!

06:48.310 --> 06:49.660
It feels good!

06:48.310 --> 06:50.590
If you want it here...

06:52.890 --> 06:53.720
Hey!

06:53.720 --> 06:57.650
I-If it isn't the Great— I mean, Blade!

06:57.650 --> 06:59.520
We were so close, too.

06:59.520 --> 07:01.340
Hey, Blade!

07:01.340 --> 07:03.770
Why are you in here like it's nothing?!

07:03.770 --> 07:06.940
Well, who else is going to wash Cu's hair?

07:06.940 --> 07:08.300
Calm down, Anna.

07:08.300 --> 07:11.720
Blade is mentally similar to 
a five-year-old, you know.

07:11.720 --> 07:12.530
There!

07:13.010 --> 07:14.030
Huh?

07:14.030 --> 07:15.260
See?

07:15.260 --> 07:16.740
Don't give me that!

07:16.740 --> 07:18.830
What are you doing, Yessica?!

07:19.580 --> 07:21.880
Five years old, you say...

07:21.880 --> 07:25.570
That's about how old Blade 
was when I first met him.

07:25.570 --> 07:26.710
Hey, Dione!

07:27.550 --> 07:28.480
Oh?

07:28.480 --> 07:31.680
When he was as old as I am now?

07:31.680 --> 07:33.840
I'd love to hear all about it.

07:36.930 --> 07:39.840
When I first met Blade...

07:39.840 --> 07:44.430
he was so ferocious,
I thought he was a wild animal.

07:44.430 --> 07:45.690
Huh...

07:46.920 --> 07:51.200
He could barely speak, and it 
seems he thought I was a horse,

07:52.480 --> 07:54.530
so he sunk his teeth into my bottom.

07:52.700 --> 07:54.530
<b>Aghhhh</b>

07:56.580 --> 07:58.730
I was still inexperienced back then,

07:58.730 --> 08:01.220
and I really was one step 
away from becoming dinner.

08:01.220 --> 08:03.500
Man, that's just like Blade.

08:04.130 --> 08:08.380
A few years after that,
after training my mind and body,

08:08.380 --> 08:11.710
I became worthy of joining forces 
with the Great Hero himself!

08:11.710 --> 08:16.240
So the rumors that you fought with 
the Great Hero are true, General?

08:16.240 --> 08:17.760
You betcha!

08:18.220 --> 08:19.410
Relax.

08:19.410 --> 08:21.980
No one can tell she's talking about you.

08:21.980 --> 08:22.680
Huh?

08:22.950 --> 08:27.130
I've even let the Great Hero ride on my back!

08:27.130 --> 08:28.340
Whoa!

08:28.800 --> 08:34.300
However, he did not let me join him 
for the fight against the Demon King.

08:34.300 --> 08:37.500
I wasn't able to act as 
his steed to the very end.

08:39.690 --> 08:43.410
In self-reproach, I took it 
as a sign of my own weakness,

08:44.090 --> 08:46.500
and now I strive to train myself further.

08:47.330 --> 08:49.290
I think that's remarkable.

08:51.380 --> 08:53.890
Are you sure no one noticed?

08:53.890 --> 08:54.960
Yes.

08:54.960 --> 08:57.830
Everyone thinks the Great Hero is much older.

08:57.830 --> 08:59.180
Ah! Makes sense.

08:59.610 --> 09:02.800
So it's our little secret.

09:02.800 --> 09:04.690
Well, you see...

09:06.770 --> 09:08.810
I was found out.

09:13.160 --> 09:14.490
Several days later!

09:15.460 --> 09:18.120
What should we bring back as a gift for Sis?

09:18.910 --> 09:19.980
Cabbage, maybe?

09:19.980 --> 09:21.240
She eats them whole, you know.

09:24.560 --> 09:25.920
Hey, Blade.

09:25.920 --> 09:28.470
So, really, what is your 
relationship with her?

09:28.470 --> 09:31.060
Well, you see...

09:31.970 --> 09:32.630
What?!

09:34.070 --> 09:35.130
A simurgh?!

09:36.000 --> 09:38.490
What's a simurgh, again?

09:38.490 --> 09:40.390
It's one of the four 
Continental Sacred Birds!

09:40.680 --> 09:44.940
Oh, so it's like a thunderbird, or a phoenix.

09:44.940 --> 09:47.890
But what's a simurgh doing 
here in the royal capital?

09:48.270 --> 09:53.090
Well, I'm sure it won't attack us, 
as long as we don't provoke it.

09:53.090 --> 09:54.060
That's true.

09:54.060 --> 09:56.700
There are no records of 
them attacking humans.

09:59.850 --> 10:00.820
Earnest!

10:01.290 --> 10:02.330
Huh?

10:08.350 --> 10:10.080
Oh, no! We need to stop it!

10:12.840 --> 10:14.380
Keep your fighting spirit in check!

10:14.380 --> 10:15.510
Okay! Okay!

10:22.010 --> 10:23.600
Two of them...

10:22.440 --> 10:23.600
Are you okay?!

10:23.600 --> 10:25.560
Are those two simurghs mates?

10:25.560 --> 10:27.040
And why?

10:27.040 --> 10:29.140
I thought they didn't attack people.

10:29.140 --> 10:31.020
It almost looked like...

10:31.020 --> 10:33.210
they were after that wagon, not people.

10:33.210 --> 10:34.110
The wagon?

10:34.450 --> 10:35.750
Could it be that...

10:36.740 --> 10:39.780
I bet that jerk's got 
something to do with this.

10:39.780 --> 10:42.530
<b>That jerk</b>

10:42.530 --> 10:44.790
<b>That
jerk</b>

10:44.790 --> 10:46.910
<b>That
jerk</b>

10:52.140 --> 10:55.000
A warm bath is really something else!

10:56.750 --> 11:00.260
Your Majesty! Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

11:00.260 --> 11:01.760
Your Majesty!

11:01.760 --> 11:03.300
We need to talk!

11:03.970 --> 11:05.300
What's the matter?

11:05.300 --> 11:06.390
You seem upset.

11:06.390 --> 11:09.640
Exactly what have you been hiding from us?!

11:10.890 --> 11:12.550
So that doesn't count as lèse-majesté?

11:12.550 --> 11:14.400
The town was under attack!

11:14.400 --> 11:17.460
Please explain what's going on here!

11:18.120 --> 11:20.450
What makes you so sure it has to do with me?

11:20.880 --> 11:23.530
The simurgh attacked a freight wagon.

11:24.130 --> 11:25.280
I see.

11:25.590 --> 11:28.430
Dione also happened to be 
pulling a freight wagon.

11:28.430 --> 11:29.570
That's true.

11:29.570 --> 11:30.590
Your Majesty!

11:30.590 --> 11:33.040
Just what was in that freight wagon?!

11:33.360 --> 11:34.340
Oh, that?

11:34.790 --> 11:35.670
It was...

11:36.670 --> 11:38.170
<b>Egg</b>

11:36.670 --> 11:38.170
An egg.

11:40.550 --> 11:43.260
You stole a simurgh egg?!

11:43.260 --> 11:46.280
Don't make such accusatory statements.

11:46.280 --> 11:47.810
I was just borrowing it for a bit.

11:48.600 --> 11:52.440
Yeah, and the parents are 
absolutely furious as a result!

11:52.440 --> 11:53.350
Gil.

11:53.350 --> 11:56.750
Don't you think you should 
thoroughly explain the situation?

11:56.750 --> 11:59.030
Yeah, guess so.

11:59.030 --> 12:00.480
The situation?

12:00.480 --> 12:01.280
Yes.

12:01.280 --> 12:05.780
There are two conditions required 
for a simurgh egg to hatch.

12:06.870 --> 12:11.400
The first is keeping at the same height
 as the 10,000-year-old sacred tree.

12:12.350 --> 12:16.590
The second is to bathe in the light of the 
setting sun at the moment of hatching.

12:18.040 --> 12:21.890
However, it seems those parents 
are new to making nests.

12:21.890 --> 12:26.150
They picked a poor location for a nest,
and the egg wouldn't have hatched if left alone.

12:26.150 --> 12:28.310
So you were trying to help them?

12:30.270 --> 12:32.020
That's the pretext, anyway.

12:32.020 --> 12:34.810
Actually, I was thinking it would be
 good practical training for all of you.

12:34.810 --> 12:36.690
A-Are you an idiot?

12:36.690 --> 12:38.080
Are you an idiot?!

12:38.080 --> 12:39.690
Good, tell it like it is!

12:39.690 --> 12:40.690
That said!

12:41.320 --> 12:44.750
It's true that, at this rate, 
the egg will not hatch.

12:44.750 --> 12:48.200
If you want to be a hero... 
no, what lies beyond...

12:48.200 --> 12:50.080
Go and save that simurgh!

12:50.080 --> 12:51.790
When is it supposed to hatch?!

12:52.150 --> 12:53.040
Tomorrow!

12:53.040 --> 12:55.650
What?!

12:57.680 --> 12:59.040
The next day!

12:59.780 --> 13:01.550
Attention!

13:03.030 --> 13:05.010
Listen up for this briefing 
from your commander!

13:09.060 --> 13:12.640
Today, we face simurghs in combat!

13:13.130 --> 13:15.880
Our goal in this fight is not to win!

13:15.880 --> 13:21.260
It is to buy us time until sunset, 
and to hide this egg from its parents!

13:22.150 --> 13:24.720
The parents are in a state of frenzy.

13:24.720 --> 13:28.280
If they spot the egg, they might 
destroy it in their fervor!

13:28.720 --> 13:31.550
We'll keep the egg concealed 
until the very last minute,

13:31.550 --> 13:35.410
then lift it up via elevator 
to the top of the tower!

13:35.410 --> 13:38.160
By doing so, the egg will successfully hatch!

13:38.160 --> 13:39.880
We'll make sure it hatches!

13:40.740 --> 13:41.820
Have no fear!

13:41.820 --> 13:44.480
Have faith in what we've 
accomplished up to this point!

13:44.480 --> 13:46.120
Have faith in yourself!

13:46.120 --> 13:47.430
U-Um...

13:47.430 --> 13:50.240
What do we do if...

13:50.240 --> 13:51.930
...we can't have faith in ourselves?

13:52.690 --> 13:55.930
It's okay if you can't 
have faith in yourselves.

13:57.810 --> 13:59.650
I have faith in you.

14:00.530 --> 14:01.570
Y-Yes!

14:02.140 --> 14:04.570
Everyone! Here we go!

14:16.880 --> 14:18.750
Are the citizens safe?

14:23.410 --> 14:25.130
We've evacuated everyone in this district!

14:25.450 --> 14:27.010
That's a relief.

14:35.850 --> 14:37.640
Look at you go, handsome!

14:45.810 --> 14:47.290
Leonard!

14:47.290 --> 14:48.190
Yessica!

14:54.020 --> 14:54.830
Clay!

14:57.510 --> 14:58.710
Take that!

15:00.950 --> 15:02.320
Shoot!

15:02.320 --> 15:04.210
Figures that wouldn't work!

15:04.560 --> 15:06.350
Okay, now's our chance!

15:13.660 --> 15:15.600
These wires are made of God Iron.

15:15.600 --> 15:17.390
Normally, it'd be impossible to sever them!

15:17.760 --> 15:18.770
Normally...

15:19.500 --> 15:20.190
Eh?

15:20.900 --> 15:21.560
Ehh?!

15:22.540 --> 15:23.840
Ehhh?!

15:23.840 --> 15:26.150
It's pulling up entire buildings?!

15:26.150 --> 15:28.070
That's absurd!

15:29.510 --> 15:31.490
But that bought us some time.

15:32.220 --> 15:33.700
Keep it up!

15:34.880 --> 15:36.530
Claire, take care of him!

15:36.530 --> 15:37.450
Yes!

15:43.670 --> 15:46.170
Have a taste of this!

15:49.800 --> 15:50.940
How's that?

15:50.940 --> 15:52.130
Give up?!

15:54.410 --> 15:56.400
It's pretty fearsome...

15:57.510 --> 15:59.350
Maria! Undo your braids!

15:59.650 --> 16:01.730
Y-Y-Yes!

16:04.620 --> 16:06.480
You would use the Demon King?

16:06.480 --> 16:08.550
Very well! Use me how you see fit!

16:08.550 --> 16:10.170
Satan Levin!

16:15.080 --> 16:17.830
So it won't pierce through a sacred bird?

16:18.140 --> 16:19.410
You're not getting away!

16:20.000 --> 16:21.710
Flame of Asmodeus!

16:27.490 --> 16:29.210
All outta gas...

16:33.010 --> 16:34.760
Bucket pudding!

16:34.760 --> 16:36.390
Jiggle...

16:39.680 --> 16:41.520
Back in action!

16:43.580 --> 16:44.770
We did it!

16:45.170 --> 16:46.450
Is everyone okay?

16:46.450 --> 16:48.340
Yes, we're fine.

16:48.340 --> 16:49.650
All that's left is...

16:49.650 --> 16:50.440
What?!

16:51.090 --> 16:53.280
Don't tell me... it stopped?

16:53.280 --> 16:54.310
It sure did stop.

16:54.310 --> 16:55.700
Yep, it stopped.

16:56.400 --> 16:59.040
Oh, no! It noticed the egg!

16:59.040 --> 17:01.010
Blade, you get the egg.

17:01.010 --> 17:02.270
Wait, but...

17:02.270 --> 17:03.380
That's right, Blade!

17:03.380 --> 17:04.860
We'll handle things here!

17:04.860 --> 17:05.940
You go on!

17:07.060 --> 17:08.210
Great Hero Blade!

17:08.210 --> 17:09.700
We'll handle them!

17:09.700 --> 17:10.840
You go on ahead!

17:13.340 --> 17:14.250
Blade!

17:14.840 --> 17:16.540
Remember what you said.

17:17.180 --> 17:18.940
Have faith in us!

17:23.040 --> 17:24.310
You're right.

17:33.650 --> 17:34.880
<i><i>This is terrifying!</i></i>

17:34.880 --> 17:38.130
<i><i>It's harder than I thought to 
only use 15% of my strength!</i></i>

17:38.130 --> 17:40.240
Great Hero!

17:40.490 --> 17:42.870
Come, get on my back!

17:43.140 --> 17:45.920
What? I thought you weren't 
going to help out!

17:45.920 --> 17:46.690
Nope!

17:46.690 --> 17:49.600
His Majesty gave strict 
orders not to lend a hand.

17:49.600 --> 17:50.130
However...

17:51.750 --> 17:54.670
I'm just letting you ride on my back.

17:54.670 --> 17:56.450
No hands involved!

18:01.530 --> 18:06.270
I was told just now to let them 
handle it, and go on ahead.

18:07.280 --> 18:09.790
It reminded me of back then,
 in a lot of ways.

18:10.910 --> 18:14.530
You're not alone anymore, 
are you, Great Hero?

18:15.710 --> 18:16.930
No, I'm not.

18:16.930 --> 18:19.620
It was just me when I fought the Demon King.

18:20.550 --> 18:23.910
But now, I have lots of friends!

18:25.830 --> 18:29.010
And of course, you're one of them, Dione!

18:29.010 --> 18:29.820
Yes!

18:32.210 --> 18:34.670
We need to carry this?

18:37.320 --> 18:38.360
No way!

18:38.360 --> 18:39.440
Ain't happening!

18:40.080 --> 18:41.890
Hm, let me think...

18:42.780 --> 18:43.870
Great Hero!

18:43.870 --> 18:46.480
Hold onto it nice and tight, just like that!

18:48.150 --> 18:49.970
Dione, what are you doing?!

18:49.970 --> 18:52.880
I'm just giving you a push!

18:52.880 --> 18:55.110
Here we go, Great Hero!

18:55.110 --> 18:56.480
H-Hey! Dione!

19:01.660 --> 19:02.620
We made it!

19:03.680 --> 19:05.490
Good work.

19:05.490 --> 19:07.310
Welcome to the finish line!

19:07.310 --> 19:09.560
I knew you'd be able to do it!

19:09.560 --> 19:12.500
After all, you are the Great Hero!

19:12.500 --> 19:14.630
I'm not a hero anymore!

19:14.630 --> 19:16.940
I only made it thanks to everyone's help.

19:18.650 --> 19:19.660
Hey, wait!

19:19.660 --> 19:21.260
It's the other simurgh!

19:21.260 --> 19:22.270
Yep.

19:22.270 --> 19:24.500
Looks like it's my time to shine now.

19:24.500 --> 19:25.010
What?

19:25.010 --> 19:28.860
I, Gilgamesh Soulmaker, 
declare here in my name!

19:28.860 --> 19:32.060
A life owed shall be repaid by new life!

19:32.060 --> 19:34.770
I'll be paying you back, right here!

19:35.710 --> 19:40.400
A simurgh once saved Gil's life.

19:40.400 --> 19:41.020
Huh?

19:40.650 --> 19:42.570
Come, simurgh.

19:41.020 --> 19:44.080
It's been playing on his 
mind this whole time.

19:42.570 --> 19:48.240
Accept my gratitude and take 
this new life into your talons!

19:44.080 --> 19:47.410
But thanks to you, 
he can finally repay his debt.

19:48.240 --> 19:50.290
Thank you, Blade.

19:52.540 --> 19:54.080
Seriously?!

19:52.920 --> 19:54.080
Ow!

19:54.080 --> 19:56.190
You should have just told us from the start!

19:54.800 --> 19:56.190
That hurts!

19:56.190 --> 19:58.420
Sheesh, you just can't be honest!

19:57.060 --> 19:58.420
Stop that! Ow!

20:00.130 --> 20:03.390
Wait, does it look angrier now?

20:03.390 --> 20:04.640
It seems that way.

20:12.690 --> 20:13.770
Watch out!

20:17.430 --> 20:19.410
Artificial Great Hero Power.

20:19.410 --> 20:20.490
Five seconds remaining.

20:20.810 --> 20:21.610
That's more than enough!

20:22.090 --> 20:24.950
Dragon Eater!

20:37.090 --> 20:39.550
I can't move a finger...

20:41.840 --> 20:43.130
So heavy...

20:43.480 --> 20:46.020
I'm lighter than Earnest, at least.

20:50.900 --> 20:53.100
Blade! The egg!

20:59.480 --> 21:00.400
Oh dear!

21:02.550 --> 21:04.450
It was twins!

21:04.720 --> 21:06.950
No wonder it was so heavy.

21:07.560 --> 21:08.030
Huh?

21:09.050 --> 21:11.370
Why are they staring at me?

21:11.840 --> 21:14.160
They're imprinting.

21:15.280 --> 21:17.960
They see Blade as their parent.

21:17.960 --> 21:20.980
Ah! You've got more children now!

21:20.980 --> 21:22.030
What are you gonna do about this?!

21:22.030 --> 21:24.170
Call me your big sister!

21:24.170 --> 21:27.090
Wait, why are you getting 
touchy with Sophie?!

21:27.090 --> 21:29.600
Now then, what to do...

21:30.880 --> 21:32.570
Several days later!

21:33.170 --> 21:34.350
H-Hey now!

21:34.350 --> 21:36.550
Please, do as I say!

21:36.550 --> 21:37.530
Okay? Okay?!

21:38.650 --> 21:40.580
Let it fly however it wants!

21:40.580 --> 21:42.110
I-I know that!

21:42.110 --> 21:43.380
I know...

21:50.880 --> 21:52.500
Parent!

21:55.200 --> 21:59.170
Man, looks like I've made even more friends!

22:18.690 --> 22:23.750
<i>The sunny disposition that 
brings a smile to your face</i>

22:23.750 --> 22:29.500
<i>As well as the heroic sense of justice</i>

22:29.500 --> 22:34.670
<i>They may be a part of me, 
but that's not all there is</i>

22:34.670 --> 22:37.370
<i>That image of me</i>

22:37.370 --> 22:40.090
<i>Has taken on a life of its own</i>

22:40.090 --> 22:42.760
<i>Hey, wait up</i>

22:42.760 --> 22:45.180
<i>Won't you be friends with me?</i>

22:45.180 --> 22:49.870
<i>Let's shake hands, another self of mine</i>

22:50.530 --> 22:53.290
<i>The wounds we cannot bear alone</i>

22:53.290 --> 22:55.960
<i>The dangers that we keep hidden</i>

22:55.960 --> 22:58.630
<i>We're all hiding them within</i>

22:58.630 --> 23:01.620
<i>Standing ready to strike</i>

23:01.620 --> 23:04.050
<i>The shadow lurking beneath the light</i>

23:04.050 --> 23:08.330
<i>The muffled sounds coming from my lips</i>

23:08.330 --> 23:13.810
<i>They make me feel that I am alive</i>

23:13.810 --> 23:15.650
<i>It's a sign</i>

23:34.550 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.390 --> 23:40.020
<b>The Springtime of Life at Rosewood Academy</b>
